{"id":"vod_lz_11757","vodId":"11757","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"食戟之灵","name_cn":"食戟之灵","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220428-1/ae1a7b4e174361cf043fc6b7e374e9a2.jpg"},"summary":"幸平创真（松冈祯丞 配音）出生于料理世家，其父经营着一间家庭餐馆，小小年纪的幸平即将父亲当做了榜样，发誓成为父亲那样的料理家。某一日，父亲找到了幸平，希望他能够进入顶级的料理学校“远月学园”深造磨练，背负着父亲的期许，幸平踏上了旅程。                                                                     　　在学校里，幸平结识了名为薙切绘里奈（种田梨沙 配音）的少女，这位传说中拥有“神之舌”的傲娇少女，竟然将幸平所作的料理判定为“不合格”。外表热情开朗内心极有城府的一色慧（樱井孝宏 配音）、拥有孱弱身体和强大头脑的丸井善二（小林裕介 配音）、活泼开朗的吉野悠姬（内田真礼 配音），与这些“同行”交流着，竞争着，幸平还有很长的路要走。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-04-28 16:46:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13069_993b6d19/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13068_11bf8810/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13070_77d5a97d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13075_6a9fbb70/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13072_548a46f3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13074_fbf4963a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13077_bd6096d4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13073_e388dc94/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13076_74f70058/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13078_f7b727ed/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13079_9f03d146/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13080_f3ae27d2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220428/13081_5d99d67f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v